  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 103.37 Disposal facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 103.37 “Disposal facility” means any location or part of a location where hazardous waste is intentionally placed and will remain after closure. The term includes landfills and land treatment facilities if the waste will remain after closure.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 103.36)",
